lass=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"主流协作机器人平台\">主流协作机器人平台</h2><p>当前市场上的主流协作机器人平台各有特色，在负载能力、感知精度和编程易用性等方面存在差异化设计。</p>\n<p><strong>Universal Robots（UR）</strong> 系列是全球市场份额最大的协作机器人品牌。UR3e/UR5e/UR10e/UR16e 覆盖 3-16 kg 负载范围，使用 Polyscope 图形化编程界面和 URScript 脚本语言。UR 的优势在于丰富的生态系统（UR+ 平台提供 300+ 认证周边设备）和简洁的编程模型。</p>\n<p><strong>Franka Emika Panda</strong> 是科研领域最受欢迎的协作机器人平台。7 轴冗余设计提供了卓越的灵活性，每个关节配备独立力矩传感器（精度 0.1 Nm）。开源的 libfranka 和 franka_ros 库使其成为算法研究的首选平台。Panda 的 1 kHz 力控频率和实时内核支持使其适合高动态力控任务。</p>\n<p><strong>ABB YuMi（IRB 14000）</strong> 是双臂协作机器人的代表。两条 7 轴手臂可独立或协同工作，专为小件装配设计。每臂负载 0.5 kg，重复定位精度 ±0.02 mm。YuMi 采用软填充外壳和低惯量设计，即使在高速运动中碰撞人体也不会造成伤害。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>自由度</th>\n<th>负载</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>力感知方式</th>\n<th>编程接口</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UR5e</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5 kg</td>\n<td>±0.03 mm</td>\n<td>电流估计</td>\n<td>URScript/Polyscope</td>\n<td>通用装配/搬运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Franka Panda</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3 kg</td>\n<td>±0.1 mm</td>\n<td>关节力矩传感器</td>\n<td>libfranka/ROS</td>\n<td>科研/精密操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABB YuMi</td>\n<td>7×2</td>\n<td>0.5 kg×2</td>\n<td>±0.02 mm</td>\n<td>电流估计</td>\n<td>RAPID</td>\n<td>小件双臂装配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KUKA iiwa</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>7/14 kg</td>\n<td>±0.1 mm</td>\n<td>关节力矩传感器</td>\n<td>Sunrise.OS/Java</td>\n<td>精密装配/磨削</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fanuc CRX</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5-25 kg</td>\n<td>±0.03 mm</td>\n<td>电流估计</td>\n<td>TP/Roboguide</td>\n<td>搬运/码垛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协作机器人编程范式\">协作机器人编程范式</h2><p>协作机器人的一大优势是降低了编程门槛，使非专业人员也能快速部署自动化方案。主流编程范式包括拖动示教、图形化编程、脚本编程和基于技能的编程。</p>\n<p><strong>拖动示教</strong>（Lead-through Teaching）是最直观的编程方式。操作员直接引导机器人末端运动，系统记录运动轨迹。示教过程中可设置路径点、工具动作和条件分支。UR 的&quot;自由驱动&quot;模式和 Franka 的&quot;引导模式&quot;都支持此功能。高级拖动示教还支持速度缩放和路径平滑优化。</p>\n<p><strong>图形化编程</strong>（Visual Programming）通过拖拽功能块构建程序流程。UR 的 Polyscope 界面提供 Move、Wait、Set、IF/ELSE 等基本节点，用户通过组合节点创建程序。这种方式适合简单的搬运和码垛任务，但在复杂逻辑和数据处理方面有局限性。</p>\n<p><strong>脚本编程</strong> 提供了更强的灵活性。URScript 是一种类 Python 的脚本语言，支持变量、函数、循环和线程。通过 URScript 可以直接访问底层控制接口，实现力控装配、视觉引导等高级功能。Franka 的 libfranka 提供 C++ API，支持 1 kHz 实时控制循环。</p>\n<p><strong>基于技能的编程</strong>（Skill-based Programming）是面向未来的编程范式。将复杂操作分解为可复用的&quot;技能&quot;单元（如&quot;抓取&quot;、&quot;插入&quot;、&quot;拧紧&quot;），每个技能封装了感知-决策-执行的完整逻辑。操作员只需选择和参数化技能即可组装新任务，大幅提高了部署效率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 编程范式演进&#10;        A[拖动示教] --&gt;|增加逻辑| B[图形化编程]&#10;        B --&gt;|增加灵活性| C[脚本编程]&#10;        C --&gt;|增加抽象| D[技能编程]&#10;        D --&gt;|增加智能| E[AI 自主学习]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 编程复杂度&#10;        A1[低门槛] --- A&#10;        B1[中等门槛] --- B&#10;        C1[专业水平] --- C&#10;        D1[系统设计] --- D&#10;        E1[AI 专家] --- E&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 编程范式演进\n        A[拖动示教] --&gt;|增加逻辑| B[图形化编程]\n        B --&gt;|增加灵活性| C[脚本编程]\n        C --&gt;|增加抽象| D[技能编程]\n        D --&gt;|增加智能| E[AI 自主学习]\n    end\n    subgraph 编程复杂度\n        A1[低门槛] --- A\n        B1[中等门槛] --- B\n        C1[专业水平] --- C\n        D1[系统设计] --- D\n        E1[AI 专家] --- E\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协作机器人通过力矩感知、碰撞检测和功率限制实现与人类的安全协作，ISO/TS 15066 定义了接触力阈值标准</li>\n<li>关节力矩传感器是碰撞检测的核心，通过比较实测力矩与模型预测力矩判断外部接触</li>\n<li>阻抗控制建立质量-弹簧-阻尼模型实现柔顺交互，是拖动示教和力控装配的理论基础</li>\n<li>主流平台各有侧重：UR 生态丰富、Franka 力感知精确、YuMi 双臂协同、iiwa 精密力控</li>\n<li>编程范式从拖动示教演进至基于技能的编程，未来将融合 AI 实现自主学习和任务泛化</li>\n<li>协作机器人正从轻负载装配向重载、高精度、多机协作等方向扩展</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协作机器人基础","id":"协作机器人基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"关节力矩感知与碰撞检测","id":"关节力矩感知与碰撞检测"},{"level":2,"text":"阻抗控制与柔顺交互","id":"阻抗控制与柔顺交互"},{"level":2,"text":"主流协作机器人平台","id":"主流协作机器人平台"},{"level":2,"text":"协作机器人编程范式","id":"协作机器人编程范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工业总线协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/industrial-automation/plc-and-scada/industrial-bus"},"next":{"title":"协作机器人安全标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/industrial-automation/collaborative-robots/safety-standards"}}